    "description": "Lumary, Let there be smart life.\r\nRemote control of smart home products, energy saving, allows you to control the smart home whenever and wherever.\r\nYou can add a variety of smart life products at the same time and control them with one application.\r\nSupport voice control by conecting to smart devices such as Amazon Echo and Google Home.\r\nIntelligent linkage, automatically running smart devices according to the temperature, location, and time.\r\nOne-click sharing device to your family and friends, lead to simple and smart life in the whole family\r\nReceive notifications everywhere and get real-time information about the smart home products in home.\r\nQuickly connect to the network, enjoy the speedy experience.",
